      "bodyHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-purple-500/30 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 font-bold rounded\">Ví dụ 4 (30s)</span>\n      <span class=\"text-slate-400\">Mức độ: Vận dụng cao</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\n      Cho $A = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R} \\mid x^2 - 4 = 0\\}$ và $B = \\{m - 1; m + 2\\}$. Tìm $m$ để $A \\subset B$:\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs\">\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700\"><b>A.</b> $m = 1$</div>\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-emerald-500 font-bold text-emerald-300\"><b>B.</b> Không tồn tại $m$</div>\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700\"><b>C.</b> $m = 0$</div>\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700\"><b>D.</b> $m = -1$</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"countdown-clock-widget cd-30s flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-900/80 rounded-lg border border-indigo-500/30\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">⏳</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-indigo-300 font-medium\">Thời gian tính toán:</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-base font-black text-amber-400 font-mono tracking-wider\">30 GIÂY</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
