      "bodyHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/30 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 font-bold rounded\">Ví dụ 2 (15s)</span>\n      <span class=\"text-slate-400\">Mức độ: Vận dụng</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-3\">\n      Cho $A = (-\\infty; 2)$, $B = [0; 4]$, $C = [1; +\\infty)$. Khi đó $(A \\cup B) \\setminus C$ là:\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs\">\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-emerald-500 font-bold text-emerald-300\"><b>A.</b> $(-\\infty; 1)$</div>\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700\"><b>B.</b> $(-\\infty; 1]$</div>\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700\"><b>C.</b> $[0; 1)$</div>\n      <div class=\"p-2 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700\"><b>D.</b> $(1; 4]$</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"countdown-clock-widget cd-15s flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-900/80 rounded-lg border border-indigo-500/30\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">⏳</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-indigo-300 font-medium\">Thời gian suy nghĩ:</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-base font-black text-amber-400 font-mono tracking-wider\">15 GIÂY</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
