      "bodyHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n  <div class=\"bg-slate-800/90 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 font-bold rounded\">Ví dụ 3 (30s)</span>\n      <span class=\"text-slate-400\">Định dạng: Đúng / Sai</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-2 font-semibold\">\n      Cho hai tập hợp $A = (-3; 2]$ và $B = (0; 5)$. Xét tính Đúng / Sai:\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs\">\n      <div class=\"p-1.5 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <span><b>a)</b> $A \\cap B = (0; 2]$</span>\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">ĐÚNG</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-1.5 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <span><b>b)</b> $A \\cup B = (-3; 5)$</span>\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">ĐÚNG</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-1.5 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <span><b>c)</b> $A \\setminus B = (-3; 0]$</span>\n        <span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">ĐÚNG</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-1.5 bg-slate-900 rounded border border-slate-700 flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <span><b>d)</b> $C_{\\mathbb{R}} B = (-\\infty; 0) \\cup (5; +\\infty)$</span>\n        <span class=\"text-rose-400 font-bold\">SAI</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"countdown-clock-widget cd-30s flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 bg-slate-900/80 rounded-lg border border-indigo-500/30\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-lg\">⏳</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-indigo-300 font-medium\">Thời gian suy nghĩ:</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-base font-black text-amber-400 font-mono tracking-wider\">30 GIÂY</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
